[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16980.31, "timestamp": "04:43:00", "text": "たくさん泣き崩れて、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16982.788, "timestamp": "04:43:02", "text": "数人の友人とビデオ会議。私は彼らに言った"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16985.51, "timestamp": "04:43:05", "text": "それについて話し合い、彼らは協力者と対峙した"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16989.59, "timestamp": "04:43:09", "text": "ゲスト、なぜトークが気に入らなかったのですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16992.39, "timestamp": "04:43:12", "text": "ジョックが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16995.868, "timestamp": "04:43:15", "text": "快適で不快で"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16999.59, "timestamp": "04:43:19", "text": "もの。ええ、あの時は良くないことでした。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17001.43, "timestamp": "04:43:21", "text": "わかった。そこから多くのことを学びました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17004.43, "timestamp": "04:43:24", "text": "経験。それで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17008.31, "timestamp": "04:43:28", "text": "えっと、私が提案するのは、ただ心を開くことです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17010.788, "timestamp": "04:43:30", "text": "それについて、もしそれが影響しているなら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17013.11, "timestamp": "04:43:33", "text": "あなたには、あなたには、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17015.51, "timestamp": "04:43:35", "text": "聴衆にあなたの気持ちを伝える"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17017.83, "timestamp": "04:43:37", "text": "そして、これは私ではないことを彼らに知らせてください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17021.59, "timestamp": "04:43:41", "text": "私はこれが好きではありません。私はこれが好きではありません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17024.23, "timestamp": "04:43:44", "text": "こういうプロっぽいのは嫌だ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17027.15, "timestamp": "04:43:47", "text": "こういうのは嫌だ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17031.67, "timestamp": "04:43:51", "text": "えっと、なんて言うんだっけ、パフォーマンス、いや、えっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17035.35, "timestamp": "04:43:55", "text": "このような行動は、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17035.784, "timestamp": "04:43:55", "author": "@Shiori_mitsuki", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Dn0VbakjSKrSNaXx6PyhznuqbomoCGx22ivSawRcMXp25Io7cfsud3H3qP-g9QprPJUESlxxtJA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "You are amazing and inspiring "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17039.27, "timestamp": "04:43:59", "text": "もの。つまり、いつもそうする必要はないということだ"}]